            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kiboienenei akirot naka Kristo kabarara kotomakus, kacoa kere: kisisianakinete ido kikwenyanaros kisabulin, ka ikososio, ka nupwakan nuka emoyo; iyeonokinete Edeke kasianut kotoma otauonokus. ",
          "type": "text",
