              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yes ibulesin, korimasi ikusijaka luka akuan kotoma akiro kere; mere kaijaanakin nakokuju kwape luitoiokito ituŋa, dimarai kaipioror nakotau, koyoŋito Ejakait, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
